close_reason: commitItemMutations journals and compensates a finalize row
contract_change:
  api: commitItemMutations / previewItemMutations mutation rows (BulkItemMutation)
  before: "A batch accepted create, update, close and release rows only. An importer finalizing exact lifecycle or extension fields wrote beside the transaction, so a later failure refused compensation with transaction_partial_mutation"
  after: "A finalize row { op, id, set, unset, match, force } writes exact front-matter fields as a journaled, compensated step recorded under the import history operation. BulkItemMutation gains BulkItemFinalizeMutation; the structured document planner types name BulkItemLifecycleMutation. New refusal finalization_invalid_document. New export runInActiveExtensionScope"
  migrate: Move a finalization written from an onTransition observer into a finalize row of the same batch. Code that switches exhaustively over BulkItemMutation op adds a finalize case; code that only reads planner output needs no change
body: ""
